[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429350\">5050B34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429735\">7210E22</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the window wiper motor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Windscreen wiper motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428665\">N15</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts.</p><p>3. Remove the assembly.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044988.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the windscreen wiper\nassembly is not damaged and operating efficiently.</p><p>Position the windscreen wiper assembly.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>WINDSCREEN WIPER ASSEMBLY</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429735\">7210E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429350\">5050B34</a></p><p>Check that the windscreen wiper works properly.</p>"]]